  "description": "The Legion L60 is a fully park, street or dirt worthy freestyle BMX bike for men, women, or kids.\nHi-Ten steel frame and mid BB shell.\nDrivetrain features 175mm 3-piece tubular chromoly hollow spindle cranks with a 25T steel chainring and mid sealed bearing bottom bracket.\n20” x 2.3” tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims with 3/8” in axle front hub and 9T cog sealed bearing cassette rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar and fork, 50 mm stem, threadless sealed integrated headset, and aluminum U-brake and brake levers.\n20.5” top tube length. Suggested rider height is 5’0” – 5’6”.",
